<p>Chant the glory of the Moons, conjuring a shroud of dancing shadows that follows you as long as this spell is active.</p><p>Each turn, a shadowy beam will hit up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> of your foes within radius 5 for 1 to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">47, 63, 75, 86, 95</acronym> damage.</p><p>This powerful spell will drain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7.6, 5.9, 4.9, 4.2, 3.6</acronym> negative energy for each beam; no beam will fire if your negative energy is too low.</p><p>You may only have one Hymn active at once.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>